      {
        "body": "State: queue work is complete per the user's update. The settled approach is repartitioning by the higher-cardinality key; consumer autoscaling stays off. Scaling consumers briefly helped and then increased contention on the same partition; the partition key concentrated evening traffic onto one partition.\nBlockers: no queue-specific blockers or open tasks are recorded. Unrelated project notes are not resolved by this completion update.\nNext concrete step: hand the completed queue work and its saved decision/evidence to the incoming owner. No further queue implementation task is asserted here; deployment and post-change validation details were not supplied.",
        "created_secs": 1792501885.0,
